---
source: apollo-router/src/uplink/license_enforcement.rs
expression: report.violation_message(connected_to_graphos)
---
Not connected to GraphOS. The features below need a GraphOS license, which the router fetches when APOLLO_KEY and APOLLO_GRAPH_REF are set.

router.yaml uses these licensed features. Remove the settings listed, or use a license that includes the features:

  Coprocessors
    coprocessor

  Request limits
    limits.router.max_depth
    limits.router.max_height

  Subscriptions
    subscription.enabled

The supergraph schema uses these licensed directives. Remove them from your subgraph schemas and recompose, or use a license that includes them:

  @authenticated  https://specs.apollo.dev/authenticated/v0.1
  @requiresScopes  https://specs.apollo.dev/requiresScopes/v0.1

See https://go.apollo.dev/o/elp for more information.
